    Open Catálogo after Precios without crashing (#40)
    
    * Open Catálogo after Precios without crashing
    
    The catalog's paged product list and the Precios picker's single-page list
    cached under the same key, so whichever screen opened second read the other's
    data: Catálogo crashed after Precios, and Precios showed no products after
    Catálogo. The paged list now has its own key.
    
